      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Service Principal",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "qziUKwnkrMq70PlCgy5xW",
      "originalText": "Service Principal",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9Kczq-DzCdY7vldnD-g40",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3513.000000000001,
      "y": 554.142807006835,
      "width": 806.639404296875,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1205480181,
      "version": 812,
      "versionNonce": 1695681685,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779389638887,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Configuration Setup:\n- If the Source Lakehouse is using uder identity the default semantic\nmodel built from the lakehouse will use SSO and therefore be a onelakle\nsecurity semantic model\n- If delegated is preferred, in the connections on the semantic model, this \nconnection must be changed to create a connection and then this connection\nwill be a connection that has access to the lakehouse.  Since this connection will\nbe used to access the lakehouse, all users who have access to the semantic model\nwill see whatever data this principal has access to (hence a delegated flow).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Configuration Setup:\n- If the Source Lakehouse is using uder identity the default semantic\nmodel built from the lakehouse will use SSO and therefore be a onelakle\nsecurity semantic model\n- If delegated is preferred, in the connections on the semantic model, this \nconnection must be changed to create a connection and then this connection\nwill be a connection that has access to the lakehouse.  Since this connection will\nbe used to access the lakehouse, all users who have access to the semantic model\nwill see whatever data this principal has access to (hence a delegated flow).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bnlFtho0ws2EP0Faie__T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400.142857142858,
      "y": 919.8570927211208,
      "width": 375.3397521972656,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2135833723,
      "version": 235,
      "versionNonce": 922439835,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779389542001,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Users accessing the \nOneLake security semantic model\nmust have a onelake role in the source\nlakehouse and will only see data that \naligns with that role",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Users accessing the \nOneLake security semantic model\nmust have a onelake role in the source\nlakehouse and will only see data that \naligns with that role",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9ayMTt7WWNk7iUl4kc_sV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2918.7142857142862,
      "y": 936.9999498639779,
      "width": 393.3197326660156,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 822260347,
      "version": 341,
      "versionNonce": 1097633531,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779389629567,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Users accessing the Delegated semantic\nmodel will see whatever the SPN can see\nbecause the access is being provided\nby that SPN.  The SPN must still have\na role in that source lakehouse (in this\ncase it is the DefaultReader role that\nis assigned to all Contributors on\nthat workspace",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Users accessing the Delegated semantic\nmodel will see whatever the SPN can see\nbecause the access is being provided\nby that SPN.  The SPN must still have\na role in that source lakehouse (in this\ncase it is the DefaultReader role that\nis assigned to all Contributors on\nthat workspace",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
